                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb0cf085-72a9-4e7a-8f91-ecca92675859",
                                "sense_id": "663165cc-5d63-3aaa-8805-9586c0157cf1",
                                "text": "На тре́тьем портре́те, пи́санном друго́ю, бо́лее иску́сною руко́ю, был предста́влен челове́к лет тридцати́, в зелё́ном мунди́ре екатери́нинского вре́мени, с кра́сными отворо́тами, в бе́лом камзо́ле, в то́нком бати́стовом га́лстуке.",
                                "translation": "The third portrait, which was the work of some other more skilful hand, represented a man of thirty, in the green uniform, with red facings, of the time of Catherine, in a white shirt, with a fine cambric cravat.",
                                "english": "The third portrait, which was the work of some other more skilful hand, represented a man of thirty, in the green uniform, with red facings, of the time of Catherine, in a white shirt, with a fine cambric cravat."
